w.iucnredlist.org/species/175930/7146492", "description": null, "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "open", "updater_id": 2059107, "created_at": "2025-01-02T10:59:27+00:00", "updated_at": "2025-01-02T10:59:27+00:00", "user": {"id": 2059107, "login": "victor_85", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 2059107, "login": "victor_85", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 97391, "name": "Europe", "display_name": "Europe", "admin_level": -10, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391]}}, {"id": 278084, "taxon_id": 59336, "taxon_name": "Ophrys bombyliflora", "taxon_rank": "species", "status": "NT", "authority": "UICN Comit\u00e9 Fran\u00e7ais", "iucn": 20, "url": "https://uicn.fr/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/tableau-liste-rouge-flore-vasculaire-de-france-metropolitaine.xlsx", "description": null, "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "obscured", "updater_id": 2479, "created_at": "2023-04-08T18:45:42+00:00", "updated_at": "2025-03-10T18:20:50+00:00", "user": {"id": 2059107, "login": "victor_85", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 2479, "login": "naturalist", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 6753, "name": "France", "display_name": "France", "admin_level": 0, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 6753]}}, {"id": 287393, "taxon_id": 59336, "taxon_name": "Ophrys bombyliflora", "taxon_rank": "species", "status": "EN", "authority": "CBN Pyr\u00e9n\u00e9es et Midi-Pyr\u00e9n\u00e9es", "iucn": 40, "url": "https://inpn.mnhn.fr/espece/listerouge/RG/LRR_Flore_Vasculaire_Midi_Pyrenees_2013", "description": null, "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "obscured", "updater_id": 2479, "created_at": "2024-04-14T11:38:16+00:00", "updated_at": "2025-03-10T18:21:06+00:00", "user": {"id": 2059107, "login": "victor_85", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 2479, "login": "naturalist", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 10579, "name": "Midi-Pyr\u00e9n\u00e9es", "display_name": "Midi-Pyr\u00e9n\u00e9es, FR", "admin_level": 10, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 6753, 10579]}}, {"id": 506436, "taxon_id": 59336, "taxon_name": "Ophrys bombyliflora", "taxon_rank": "species", "status": "Precautionary (illegal collection risk; salep trade threat)", "authority": "CITES Secretariat (CITES)", "iucn": 0, "url": "https://cites.org/sites/default/files/documents/E-CoP19-Inf-09_1.pdf", "description": "Precautionary geoprivacy for Turkey due to documented, large-scale illegal harvesting of terrestrial, tuberous orchids for salep production. Harvesting involves uprooting the tuber, which kills the plant, and is explicitly prohibited under Turkish national law\u2014yet continues at very high levels. CITES-cited estimates report ~30\u2013120 million tubers collected annually, with documented population declines and local extinctions in some regions. Because precise locality disclosure can facilitate further collection, Turkey observations are obscured. Sources: CITES E-CoP19-Inf-09_1; K\u00fchn & Pedersen (2019); Delforge (2006).", "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "obscured", "updater_id": 7739024, "created_at": "2026-02-11T19:58:29+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-02-11T19:58:29+00:00", "user": {"id": 7739024, "login": "michael_bommerer", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 7739024, "login": "michael_bommerer", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 7183, "name": "T\u00fcrkiye", "display_name": "T\u00fcrkiye", "admin_level": 0, "ancestor_place_ids": [97395, 7183]}}, {"id": 509240, "taxon_id": 59336, "taxon_name": "Ophrys bombyliflora", "taxon_rank": "species", "status": "LC", "authority": "CBN Corse", "iucn": 10, "url": "https://sbocc.fr/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Liste-rouge-Corse.pdf", "description": null, "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "open", "updater_id": 2059107, "created_at": "2026-03-18T19:52:12+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-03-18T19:52:12+00:00", "user": {"id": 2059107, "login": "victor_85", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 2059107, "login": "victor_85", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 10574, "name": "Corse", "display_name": "Corse, FR", "admin_level": 10, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 6753, 10574]}}, {"id": 509054, "taxon_id": 790400, "taxon_name": "Orchidinae", "taxon_rank": "subtribe", "status": "Sensitive (precautionary geoprivacy)", "authority": "CITES Secretariat (CITES)", "iucn": 5, "url": "", "description": "Precautionary location protection applied to limit dissemination of precise coordinates for a location-sensitive taxon potentially vulnerable to harvesting and illegal trade. All native orchid species are legally protected from international trade by listing under CITES Appendix II. Large scale wild harvesting (e.g., for salep production) has been documented as a pressure on certain populations in some Greek regions. This designation is intended as a risk-reduction measure only and does not represent a formal conservation assessment.", "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "obscured", "updater_id": 773179, "created_at": "2026-03-10T17:17:59+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-03-10T17:17:59+00:00", "user": {"id": 773179, "login": "abounabat", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 773179, "login": "abounabat", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 53571, "name": "Macedonia and Thrace", "display_name": "Macedonia and Thrace, GR", "admin_level": 10, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 7094, 53571]}}, {"id": 509076, "taxon_id": 790400, "taxon_name": "Orchidinae", "taxon_rank": "subtribe", "status": "Precautionary (Strict National Protection / Illegal Harvesting Risk)", "authority": "Turkish Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry / CITES Appendix II", "iucn": 0, "url": "", "description": "*All wild orchid species in Turkey* are subject to **strict national conservation laws** and **international trade regulations**. Under the *Regulation on Harvesting, Production, and Export of Flower Bulbs* (Official Gazette No. 22371) and the *Turkish Penal Code*, the **unauthorized uprooting, collection, or damaging of wild orchids and their underground parts is strictly prohibited**. As all members of *Orchidinae* are listed under **CITES Appendix II**, and **precise locality data** has been documented to facilitate **illegal extraction in violation of national law**, geoprivacy is **obscured** to ensure compliance with Turkish conservation mandates and to **prevent the unauthorized removal of protected biological resources**.", "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "obscured", "updater_id": 7739024, "created_at": "2026-03-11T14:36:27+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-03-11T14:39:22+00:00", "user": {"id": 7739024, "login": "michael_bommerer", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 7739024, "login": "michael_bommerer", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 7183, "name": "T\u00fcrkiye", "display_name": "T\u00fcrkiye", "admin_level": 0, "ancestor_place_ids": [97395, 7183]}}, {"id": 509052, "taxon_id": 47217, "taxon_name": "Orchidaceae", "taxon_rank": "family", "status": "Sensitive (precautionary geoprivacy)", "authority": "Hellenic Ministry of Environment & Energy (CITES Management Authority) / CITES Secretariat", "iucn": 0, "url": "https://ypen.gov.gr/", "description": "Precautionary location protection applied to limit dissemination of precise coordinates for a location-sensitive taxon potentially vulnerable to targeted disturbance. Native orchid species occurring in Greece are protected under Presidential Decree 67/1981 (national), Council Regulation (EC) No 338/97 (European Union), and CITES Appendix II (international). Wild harvesting of orchids (e.g. for salep production) has been documented as a pressure on certain populations. This designation is intended as a risk-reduction measure only and does not represent a formal conservation assessment.", "source_id": null, "geoprivacy": "obscured", "updater_id": 7739024, "created_at": "2026-03-10T16:14:39+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-03-10T17:31:05+00:00", "user": {"id": 7739024, "login": "michael_bommerer", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "updater": {"id": 7739024, "login": "michael_bommerer", "icon_url": null, "orcid": null}, "place": {"id": 7094, "name": "Greece", "display_name": "Greece", "admin_level": 0, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 7094]}}], "conservation_status": null, "listed_taxa_count": 4, "listed_taxa": [{"id": 8112374, "taxon_id": 59336, "establishment_means": "native", "place": {"id": 97391, "name": "Europe", "display_name": "Europe", "admin_level": -10, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391]}, "list": {"id": 313166, "title": "Europe Check List"}}, {"id": 8204070, "taxon_id": 59336, "establishment_means": "native", "place": {"id": 6753, "name": "France", "display_name": "France", "admin_level": 0, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 6753]}, "list": {"id": 7069, "title": "France Check List"}}, {"id": 115549611, "taxon_id": 59336, "establishment_means": "native", "place": {"id": 10579, "name": "Midi-Pyr\u00e9n\u00e9es", "display_name": "Midi-Pyr\u00e9n\u00e9es, FR", "admin_level": 10, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 6753, 10579]}, "list": {"id": 4452241, "title": "Orchid\u00e9es de Midi-Pyr\u00e9n\u00e9es"}}, {"id": 8204071, "taxon_id": 59336, "establishment_means": "native", "place": {"id": 10574, "name": "Corse", "display_name": "Corse, FR", "admin_level": 10, "ancestor_place_ids": [97391, 6753, 10574]}, "list": {"id": 13335, "title": "Corse Check List"}}], "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Ophrys bombyliflora</b></i>, the <b>bumblebee orchid</b>, is a species of <i>Ophrys</i> (bee orchid), native from the Mediterranean region from Portugal and the Canary Islands to Turkey and Lebanon. The genus name <i><i title=\"Greek language text\">Ophrys</i></i> is from the Greek in reference to the hairy lips of the flowers of this genus; the specific epithet <i><i title=\"Latin language text\">bombyliflora</i></i> is from the Greek <i>bombylios</i> (bumblebee) in reference to the appearance of the flowers of this species.", "vision": true}}